+# This workflow runs Go-related validation (test, lint, build, codegen, e2e).
+# It triggers only when Go source code, module files, Makefile, or hack scripts change.
+# It does NOT trigger on documentation, UI, or release-only changes.
+# Trigger scope:
+#   - Go source files: **/*.go
+#   - Go module files: go.mod, go.sum
+#   - Build configuration: Makefile
+#   - Build/hack scripts: hack/**
+#   - Workflow itself: .github/workflows/ci-build.yaml
+#   - Linter configuration: .golangci.yaml
